Package: raw-gadget-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: USB Raw Gadget kernel module (DKMS)
 Raw Gadget lets a userspace program act as a USB device by handling every
 USB request itself. It is part of the mainline Linux kernel
 (CONFIG_USB_RAW_GADGET) but the Raspberry Pi OS kernels are built without
 it. This package builds the module with DKMS for every installed kernel
 and rebuilds it when a kernel is updated.
 .
 The source is the out-of-tree copy from xairy/raw-gadget.
